+## HTTPS
+
+Set `server.protocol` to `https` and provide readable certificate and private key files. HTTPS uses `server.https_port` for the REST API and UI and TLS on `server.grpc_port`. Flipt checks that both files exist during configuration and loads the certificate and key before starting listeners.
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  https_port: 443
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/cert.pem
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/key.pem
+```
+
 ## Databases
 
 Flipt supports both [SQLite](https://www.sqlite.org/index.html) and [Postgres](https://www.postgresql.org/) databases as of `v0.5.0`.
